en:
"C'mon, it's not that great.
That weird thing's brought us nothin' but grief.
Let's just ditch it already, right around here's fine..."{w}

"Yeah, right!
We got tossed inside it, the terrain changed every single time,
it put us through hell, y'know!? Toss it, toss it!"{w}

"Once we took it out of that place, it stopped doing anything, right?
If we just figure out how to use it, it'll be A-OK...
Ah, I said don't throw it away!"{w}

"And who's gonna figure that out?
If we can't toss it, then we hand it off to somebody... Oh?
Perfect timing. Hey, you folks want this?"{w}

"We picked it up in the Crotoa City Ruins, and
get this! It's a Strange Box Garden -- you can go inside it
and have all kinds of adventures! Whaddaya say?"{w}

"But if you're goin' in, watch yourselves.
It's a real handful in there.
See ya!"{w}

"If you put that box garden back where it was
in the Crotoa City Ruins, you can get inside.
As for the spot... ...Sorry, I forgot."{w}

"But if you're goin' in, watch yourselves.
It's a real handful in there.
See ya!"{w}

Deep in the desert,
there was a monster of grotesque form.{w}{p}Why did it look this way?{w}Why had it been locked up?{w}Why was it here?{w}{p}All of it was shrouded in mystery.{w}But judging by that raised fist,{w}{p}he (or she),
as far as you were concerned, at least,{w}was hardly a presence to be welcomed, it is safe to say.{w}

{0E}"Ugh, honestly! You're all exaggerating!
If someone's in trouble, I help them.{0F}
That's only natural, right?"{w}

{0E}"One way or another, you guys sure know a lot...
I really do need to study.{0F}
And I have to work harder at alchemy, too..."{w}

{0E}"Ninja! Ninja's the way to go!
YAMURU IS DECAPITATED!{0F}
*ding* R.I.P.!"{w}

"You can just go end up
    *INSIDE THE STONE*
all by yourself!"{w}

{0E}"Those two make an Angel's Window...
I know that one, since I've made it before.{0F}
And then Ma... Mazu... Mazu-ree-tay?"{w}

{0E}"Yamuru!{0F}
...It's all right, okay?"{w}{p}"If I wanted to change classes, I wouldn't be studying alchemy.{w}I'm studying like this because
I decided to keep at it, see?"{w}

"Ah! Don't you run away, you bastard!
I didn't get to lop off a single head!
HEEEADS!!"{w}

"Oh ho, I never expected to run into you so suddenly.{w}But tell me, how do you differ from the five primal races?
What was this generational succession even for!"{w}{p}"Come, let us have a little bout, shall we?{w}This power of the Ryug I have heard such rumors of --
show it to me!!"{w}
